{"seq":3,"slug":"hypersonic-weapons","title":"高超声速武器","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/aerospace-military-tech/hypersonic-weapons","wordCount":1393,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"高超声速武器\">高超声速武器</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>高超声速武器是指飞行速度超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mach </mtext><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mach}\\ 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mach</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6174</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km/h</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6174\\,\\text{km/h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6174</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km/h</span></span></span></span></span></span>）的打击性武器系统。它代表当前军事技术竞争的最前沿，被视为「改变游戏规则」的颠覆性技术——因为它结合了弹道导弹的高速度和巡航导弹的可机动性，使现有 <a href=\"ballistic-missiles\">弹道导弹防御系统</a> 面临根本性挑战。</p>\n<p>理解高超声速武器的钥匙，是看清它为什么「难防」：传统弹道导弹沿可预测的抛物线飞行，而高超声速武器在大气层内/边缘以极高速度全程机动，始终保持在中段拦截系统的拦截包线之外。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    HGV[&quot;高超声速滑翔飞行器 HGV&lt;br/&gt;弹道助推→无动力滑翔机动&quot;]&#10;    HCM[&quot;高超声速巡航导弹 HCM&lt;br/&gt;超燃冲压全程动力巡航&quot;]&#10;    HGV --&gt; CHAL[&quot;共同特征:速度快·可机动·难拦截&quot;]&#10;    HCM --&gt; CHAL&#10;    CHAL -.冲击.-&gt; BMD[&quot;传统中段拦截失效&quot;]\">graph TD\n    HGV[\"高超声速滑翔飞行器 HGV&lt;br/&gt;弹道助推→无动力滑翔机动\"]\n    HCM[\"高超声速巡航导弹 HCM&lt;br/&gt;超燃冲压全程动力巡航\"]\n    HGV --&gt; CHAL[\"共同特征:速度快·可机动·难拦截\"]\n    HCM --&gt; CHAL\n    CHAL -.冲击.-&gt; BMD[\"传统中段拦截失效\"]</pre><h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"两大技术路线对比\">两大技术路线对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路线</th>\n<th>动力方式</th>\n<th>典型速度</th>\n<th>代表型号</th>\n<th>状态（2026）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HGV 滑翔飞行器</td>\n<td>弹道助推后无动力滑翔</td>\n<td>Mach 17–20+</td>\n<td>俄「先锋」、中 DF-ZF、美 LRHW</td>\n<td>「先锋」已服役</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HCM 巡航导弹</td>\n<td>超燃冲压（Scramjet）</td>\n<td>Mach 5–8</td>\n<td>俄「锆石」、美 HACM</td>\n<td>「锆石」已装备俄海军</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"技术路线一-高超声速滑翔飞行器-hgv\">技术路线一：高超声速滑翔飞行器（HGV）</h3><p>HGV 由弹道导弹助推到大气层外，分离后以无动力滑翔在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>100</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\text{–}100\\,\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span> 近空间高超声速飞行，具备横向机动。「钱学森弹道」是其理论基础：飞行器如在水面「打水漂」般多次进出大气层，延长射程并增加不可预测性。</p>\n<p>HGV 面临严峻的气动加热。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mach </mtext><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mach}\\ 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mach</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 速度下，驻点温度为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_0 = T_\\infty \\left(1 + \\frac{\\gamma - 1}{2} M^2\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M=20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>220</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_\\infty=220\\,\\text{K}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">220</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">K</span></span></span></span></span></span>，驻点温度超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>17000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">17000\\,\\text{K}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">K</span></span></span></span></span></span>，远超任何已知材料耐温极限。因此 HGV 必须采用烧蚀防热，前缘使用超高温陶瓷（如 ZrB₂-SiC 复合材料，可耐 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2000°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 以上）——这是 <a href=\"../emerging-military-tech/directed-energy-weapons\">材料科学</a> 在军事工程中的极限挑战。</p>\n<p>俄罗斯「先锋」（Avangard）是世界首款实战部署的 HGV，由 UR-100N UTTH 搭载，滑翔速度超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mach </mtext><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mach}\\ 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mach</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>、射程超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6000\\,\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span>，2019 年 12 月服役。中国 DF-ZF（东风-17 HGV）2019 年阅兵公开，速度约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mach </mtext><mn>5</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mach}\\ 5\\text{–}10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mach</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>。美国 LRHW 采用通用滑翔体 C-HGB，滑翔速度超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mach </mtext><mn>17</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mach}\\ 17</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mach</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">17</span></span></span></span></span>、射程约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2775</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2775\\,\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2775</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span>，陆军版「暗鹰」（Dark Eagle）首个作战连的列装于 2025 年底启动、预计 2026 年初完成，部署于太平洋战区（首批列装于华盛顿州刘易斯-麦科德联合基地）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"技术路线二-高超声速巡航导弹-hcm\">技术路线二：高超声速巡航导弹（HCM）</h3><p>HCM 使用超燃冲压发动机（Scramjet）全程动力飞行，在大气层内持续以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mach </mtext><mn>5</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mach}\\ 5\\text{–}8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mach</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 巡航。超燃冲压利用高速前进压缩空气（无需压气机），在超声速气流中喷燃料燃烧——气流在燃烧室驻留仅约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>，被形容为「在飓风中点燃火柴」。俄罗斯「锆石」（3M22）速度约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mach </mtext><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mach}\\ 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mach</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>、射程约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000\\,\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span>，2023 年起装备俄海军（反舰应用见 <a href=\"../weapon-systems/naval-weapon-systems\">海战武器装备</a>）。美国 AGM-183A ARRW 多次试射失败后被取消，转投 HACM 项目，计划 2027 年前形成初始作战能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"防御挑战\">防御挑战</h3><p>高超声速武器对现有防御构成系统性挑战：探测困难（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>60</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\text{–}60\\,\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span> 高度低于天基红外最优探测角）、跟踪困难（持续机动使轨道预测不可能）、拦截困难（拦截弹机动性不足）。应对方案包括部署 <a href=\"military-satellites\">SDA 跟踪层低轨星座</a> 实现全球持续跟踪、发展「滑翔阶段拦截器」（GPI），以及利用 <a href=\"../emerging-military-tech/directed-energy-weapons\">定向能武器</a> 以光速拦截。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2024–2026 年关键动态：美国加速推进多个项目，「暗鹰」LRHW 完成首个作战连列装；中国进行多次高超声速飞行器试验（含可重复使用飞行器）；俄罗斯在乌克兰冲突中首次实战使用「匕首」空射高超声速导弹（实为空射弹道导弹，而非真正 HGV 或 HCM）；日本、澳大利亚、印度启动各自研发；美国 MDA 推进「滑翔阶段拦截器」概念研究，寻求 2030 年前具备初步拦截能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>HGV 和 HCM 各有什么技术优劣势？哪种技术路线更具实战前景？（提示：对照上表的动力方式与速度）</li>\n<li>高超声速武器是否会破坏现有核战略稳定？当一国拥有常规高超声速打击能力时，对方可能如何误判意图？</li>\n<li>高超声速武器防御为什么如此困难？从探测、跟踪到拦截，哪个环节最具技术挑战？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章姊妹篇：<a href=\"ballistic-missiles\">弹道导弹与防御系统</a>（高超声速如何绕过中段拦截）、<a href=\"military-satellites\">军事卫星系统</a>（跟踪层）。</li>\n<li>再入热防护的材料挑战、光速拦截方案见 <a href=\"../emerging-military-tech/directed-energy-weapons\">定向能武器</a>；反舰应用见 <a href=\"../weapon-systems/naval-weapon-systems\">海战武器装备</a>；空射型号见 <a href=\"../weapon-systems/air-weapon-systems\">空战武器装备</a>。</li>\n<li>高超声速对战略稳定的影响见 <a href=\"../../military-theory/\">军事理论</a>。</li>\n<li>本 hub 整体定位见 <a href=\"../\">军事技术学科简介</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>高超声速武器代表当代军事技术竞争的最前沿。HGV 利用弹道导弹初始速度进行超远程精确打击，HCM 通过超燃冲压实现持续动力巡航，两者共同的优势在于速度快、可机动、难拦截。高超声速武器正深刻改变攻防平衡，迫使各国重新审视战略威慑理论和防御体系。未来十年将是高超声速技术从突破到成熟的关键时期——把它放在 <a href=\"ballistic-missiles\">弹道导弹攻防</a> 的「矛与盾」框架中理解，便能看清它为何是当代战略博弈最锋利的一支矛。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高超声速武器","id":"高超声速武器"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"两大技术路线对比","id":"两大技术路线对比"},{"level":3,"text":"技术路线一：高超声速滑翔飞行器（HGV）","id":"技术路线一-高超声速滑翔飞行器-hgv"},{"level":3,"text":"技术路线二：高超声速巡航导弹（HCM）","id":"技术路线二-高超声速巡航导弹-hcm"},{"level":3,"text":"防御挑战","id":"防御挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"弹道导弹与防御系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/aerospace-military-tech/ballistic-missiles"},"next":{"title":"人工智能与自主武器","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/emerging-military-tech/ai-autonomous-weapons"}}